WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.116
AI can recognize patterns, predict, recommend, generate, and take actions.

00:00:06.116 --> 00:00:12.232
A system learns from many examples, then applies patterns to something new.

00:00:12.232 --> 00:00:18.348
A photo, document, message, or sensor reading becomes a useful result.

00:00:18.348 --> 00:00:24.464
Photo recognition labels a scene; invoice processing extracts fields and flags exceptions.

00:00:24.464 --> 00:00:30.580
Important or uncertain results need evidence, review, and a safe handoff.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:36.696
AI performs tasks associated with intelligence, but it is not ChatGPT, fixed-rule automation, or the human mind.
